  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can weave and warp magical patterns with but a thought.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Spontaneous Conversion<sup>WK</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat as a swift action, or as a standard action at one-half the normal ki point cost (rounding up). If you know the mythic version of the new spell you have prepared, you can cast it by expending mythic power as normal.</p>\n<p>If you do know the non-mythic version of the spell but do not know the mythic version, you can cast the mythic version by expending a number of uses of mythic power equal to one-half the spell’s level (rounding up), in addition to the normal cost in mythic power to cast that spell as a mythic or augmented mythic spell.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc71\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
